<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FOREIGNERS BUY 0.76 MLN RAND S.AFRICAN BONDS FRI.</title>
<headline>FOREIGNERS BUY 0.76 MLN RAND S.AFRICAN BONDS FRI.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 757,697 rand worth of South African bonds on Friday after buying 48.79 million rand on Thursday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
